}}'''Frozen''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife which was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier of the [[Christmas Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. The blade has a turquoise blue colour on the top, and at the top of the guard it melts into a darker grey colour. The guard is golden and the handle is black.

==Trivia==
*It has a  [[Frozen Gun (2023)|partner gun]] under the same name.

